+## Audit coverage diagnostics
+
+The inspector now includes structured fallback flags and counts for budget exhaustion, unknown top-level site, unknown CEF resource type and oversized/invalid classification input. Unknown resource types continue as `other` for rule compatibility. Flags can overlap and can accompany a rule-based block; they are coverage observations, not a count of all packets or proof that unobserved traffic was inspected. Clear resets them; pause skips list evaluation and remains explicit. Native coverage verification is pending.
